<LanguageData>
  <MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.Section>命运之轮</MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.Section>
  <MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.InitialTheme.Label>将开局叙事主题在开局时锁定为推演伊始</MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.InitialTheme.Label>
  <MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.InitialTheme.Description>开启后，命运之轮在开局时将优先进入“推演伊始叙事”主题。这是一个轻松的开局主题。</MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.InitialTheme.Description>
