  <MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.ThemeSelection.Description>被取消勾选的叙事主题的选择权重降为 0，不会自然生成。</MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.ThemeSelection.Description>
  <MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.ThemeSelection.InitialOnly>此主题的默认轮换权重为 0，不参与轮换。</MAP_WheelOfFate.Settings.ThemeSelection.InitialOnly>
